<%# A card in its slot — the unit the feed reorders/inserts, while the inner
    .survey-card-wrap carries the CTA rail + the framed, selectable card.
    The "Add question" CTA lives in the rail now (add_question#open resolves
    its insertion point via closest(.card-slot), so the slot is still the
    anchor a new card is spliced in after). %>
<div class="card-slot">
  <%= render "surveys/card_row", card: card, idx: idx, q_idx: q_idx, total_q: total_q,
        default_locale: default_locale, quiz: local_assigns.fetch(:quiz, false),
        tokenisation: local_assigns.fetch(:tokenisation, false) %>
</div>
